  (80, 'https://www.amerisbank.com/getmedia/bb66ae8e-7de9-4cb3-9699-011b683309d5/Misc-Pricing-Guide.pdf', 'text_pdf', '3e3c6695a6711b1d855ec9d7e035d20782124bc9965f4c0394f809fd1ead91d1', 'confirmed', 'GA answer key: keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 1338 (not yet checked by a person). Ameris Misc Services Pricing Guide (eff. 6/11/2025): page 1 all customers, page 2 business-only. Two-column table flattened, so source_lines include neighbouring column. Treasury fees (Positive Pay, RBD, EDD, etc.) included as unmapped. Overdraft cap is a count (3/day), not a dollar cap, so no od_daily_cap entry. No maintenance fees in this doc.', 'knox-hand-key-states-2026-10-06'),
  (82, 'https://www.wafdbank.com/personal-banking/account-fees', 'html', '10ff86f1426e43d4aa7a2bd7402242018b548d08b2354bf09ea19592f3a1a5df', 'prefilled', 'stratum: regional / bank / html (WA)', 'manual-read-of-stored-text-2026-10-04'),
  (115, 'https://www.seacoastbank.com/hubfs/Consumer_Account_Fees_and_Service_Charges_Rev09-25.pdf', 'text_pdf', 'c787c38d1b97ac99c4e7e12d3e93b0259162d80bb6c031182d480a819fed56e4', 'confirmed', 'FL answer key: keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 8085 (not yet checked by a person). Seacoast consumer fees (effective Aug 1 2025); 3-column PDF text merged, so many source_lines contain two unrelated fees (e.g. SDB sizes share lines with research/stop-payment fees). NSF and overdraft share one $35 line (two entries); 7/day cap is a count, not a $ cap. ''Faxed $15'' in LOAN column is unclear (uncertain). SDB ''Late Fee $10'' assumed to be safe-deposit late fee by position (uncertain). Online Banking ''With select accounts No Cost'' not recorded as a fee.', 'knox-hand-key-states-2026-10-06'),
