  (458, 'https://www.uscentury.com/assets/files/RDge3LXR', 'text_pdf', 'c2abc5c8158f24b356115816a2e06e95eef2836bff9ef9793cb2e18eb554343b', 'confirmed', 'FL answer key: keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 10193 (not yet checked by a person). U.S. Century Bank BUSINESS fee schedule (eff. Nov 1 2025); two-column PDF merged with '' | ''. Maintenance fees recorded per account product (8 products list no maintenance fee). Cash processing and transaction fees printed as ''.20¢'' (literally 0.2 cents) on most lines; recorded as $0.20 using the one line that reads ''$.20 per $100'' (uncertain). Printed statement $6.95 appears twice (lines 22 and 122); recorded once. Safe deposit box billing period not stated. Overdraft Interest Rate 18% excluded (interest). Key Deposit $25 may be refundable (uncertain). Incoming wire not labeled domestic/international.', 'knox-hand-key-states-2026-10-06'),
