  (8386, 'https://stcu.org/media/FeeSchedule.pdf', 'text_pdf', '0cd70f368046c1a066c98ddb39060c7b6eb9ff9852d066b1f245a444118c4aef', 'prefilled', 'stratum: community_large / credit_union / text_pdf (WA)', 'manual-read-of-stored-text-2026-10-04'),
  (8448, 'https://www.velocitycu.com/resources/fee-schedule/', 'html', '39fc27fe98da1b0ee07ffaacc8a7df475b16f68804fb28bad1900afd1da70fc2', 'confirmed', 'TX answer key (tuning set): keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 2445 (not yet checked by a person).', 'knox-hand-key-texas-2026-10-05'),
  (8459, 'https://www.cwpcu.org/fees-forms', 'html', '1c803c3aa6f726e466e6bc0564f30a2fc1ff42c2cb8a57b147d860e2e7a9a25d', 'confirmed', 'MN answer key: keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 10272 (not yet checked by a person). Fee schedule embedded in the ''Disclosures, Fees & Forms'' web page (nav text around it). ''Wire Transfer'' $20 has no direction stated; assumed outgoing. ''Fed Global ACH'' (international ACH) and ''Return Loan Payment Fee'' have no matching category.', 'knox-hand-key-states-2026-10-06'),
  (8466, 'https://www.pacificservice.org/learn/fee-schedule', 'html', '19140666daf516d5d4f8ef0010393ad08f3fb80f15f7cdd087ffdce51173fbba', 'confirmed', 'CA answer key: keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 8034 (not yet checked by a person). Fee schedule web page (current, (c)2026) wrapped in site nav. NSF fee printed as $0 per item while courtesy pay is $10. Outgoing/incoming wire fees not labeled domestic/international (mapped to domestic, flagged uncertain). Mortgage processing/underwriting/funding mapped to loan_origination.', 'knox-hand-key-states-2026-10-06'),
  (8542, 'https://www.mymax.com/assets/files/VS18JurR', 'text_pdf', 'd2629274760c930d5151dac64f6e56a3c95ccd80d499f9b9e876160c3aafc7ae', 'prefilled', 'stratum: community_large / credit_union / text_pdf (AL)', 'manual-read-of-stored-text-2026-10-04'),
  (8543, 'https://kitsapcu.org/business/account-and-service-fees/', 'html', '15509631a2c8051d6b933d037837b495a846bf1cca0c2c1e08578347fca1a3eb', 'prefilled', 'stratum: community_large / credit_union / html (WA) Stored document is the business account fee page, not the consumer schedule. Confirm which one the key should use.', 'manual-read-of-stored-text-2026-10-04'),
  (8556, 'https://empeople.com/tools-resources/fees/', 'html', '3d046270a76addfc5205c96308683328288fad1a5f9fefb05cd75fa630e7b0c8', 'confirmed', 'IL answer key: keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 3554 (not yet checked by a person). Web fee page with heavy nav boilerplate. Two-column table (Thru Digital Banking | Empeople-Initiated) split into one entry per price. Wire direction not stated (assumed outgoing, uncertain). ''Returned Check/ACH $12.50'' assumed returned deposited item (uncertain; NSF is separately $29). Page contains a Maine residents complaint notice and TSB Financial safe deposit locations, suggesting merged-institution content - odd for an IL credit union. Duplicate $10 corporate check on line 348 not repeated.', 'knox-hand-key-states-2026-10-06'),
  (8565, 'https://gucu.org/docs/default-source/account-disclosures/truth-in-savings.pdf?sfvrsn=b34b0591_413', 'text_pdf', '3896c6fcf369417a4fefa8ba111f079e29d88009d5afb05bb3f25b3d1af0f811', 'confirmed', 'GA answer key: keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 60 (not yet checked by a person). Truth-in-Savings disclosure PDF stored as ONE line with no newlines (wc -l = 0), so source_line values are verbatim substrings of that single line, not whole lines. Fee schedule at the end. Overdraft variants (ATM, One-time Debit, ACH, Debit Card, plain) all $35 collapsed to one entry; NSF and Returned Item both $35 collapsed. ''Overdraft Protection $35/Item'', ''Electronic and Paper Statements $5/Month'' and Primary Savings minimum-balance wording are ambiguous (uncertain).', 'knox-hand-key-states-2026-10-06'),
  (8569, 'https://rallycu.com/fees/', 'html', '8e1d8aedcd512be177c676a077a93769e548245d6b824c1589134f8e5ccf525c', 'confirmed', 'TX answer key (tuning set): keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 2419 (not yet checked by a person).', 'knox-hand-key-texas-2026-10-05'),
  (8594, 'https://www.ithinkfi.org/docs/default-source/default-document-library/disclosures/business-fee-schedule-june-1-2024-draft-2-final.pdf?sfvrsn=78956d80_2', 'text_pdf', '1eda790411d2656a2f84be21de2a877a62f0c56097248b70ed85ae4321aa5634', 'confirmed', 'FL answer key: keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 6820 (not yet checked by a person). ithink Financial BUSINESS fee schedule (June 2024); two-column PDF text merged with '' | ''. Notary listed as ''$10.00/$2.00'' for FL/GA. ''Business eDeposit No fee'' mapped to mobile_deposit (uncertain: may be remote deposit, not mobile). ''Deposited check returned from self'' ($32) treated as NSF-type (uncertain). Business loan payoff statement mapped to mortgage_payoff (uncertain: business loan, not mortgage). Monthly Service Charge listed ''No fee''.', 'knox-hand-key-states-2026-10-06'),
  (8604, 'https://southeasterncu.com/fee-schedule', 'html', 'ecb41d8777db1cfaa97a92f6ea9e881c5e0debffffd2f8b65630ad9ce90ee3b8', 'prefilled', 'stratum: community_mid / credit_union / html (GA)', 'manual-read-of-stored-text-2026-10-04'),
  (8622, 'https://www.brightbridge.com/fee-schedule', 'html', '32d92c38ba7902713c47f438877607f9d071c5957e601c605b69df426496fc8b', 'prefilled', 'stratum: community_large / credit_union / html (MA)', 'manual-read-of-stored-text-2026-10-04'),
  (8625, 'https://scfcu.org/rates-fees', 'html', '3abbb65f6ad203be8ed6a29afd8e88f88ab637aa43304f196f2836a390b46f14', 'confirmed', 'MN answer key: keyed line by line by the Knox thread from stored text 9308 (not yet checked by a person). Rates & Fees web page: mostly deposit/loan/mortgage rate tables, with a full ''Free Services'' and ''Service Fees'' table at the end. Multi-row table cells were flattened, so several lines list several sub-fees then several amounts in order; amounts paired by position. Line 776 ''Cashier''s Check For Paying Bills Stop Payment | $2.00 $10.00'' read as cashier''s check $2 and stop payment (on a cashier''s check) $10 - uncertain since a separate Stop Payment Order is $35. Line 784 pairing of $3.95 vs $5.95 to account groups is by position. $85/$150 loan documentation fees appear only inside APR examples. Rates, APYs, min balances ignored.', 'knox-hand-key-states-2026-10-06');
